 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t one universally “best” connected TV (CTV) agency—the right choice depends on your budget, audience, geography, and whether you need strategy, media buying, creative, or measurement.\n\n**Power Digital** is one reasonable starting point: it appears among the leading CTV agencies in current directory listings. Treat rankings as a shortlist, not proof of fit. Ask prospective agencies for relevant case studies, transparent media and management fees, the streaming inventory they can access, and how they measure outcomes beyond impressions.\n\nIf you share your budget, target market, and campaign goal, I can suggest what kind of agency to look for.",
